        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> Obviously this news makes us all very sad and a little scared.  Most important is that Dahlea is safe and we all wish her the best of luck through these times and pray that she comes back soon.</P><P>Elders are asked to contact me in game this evening so we can get together and decide how to proceed.  Both myself and Wrenne are in game now.</P><P>As much as we hate it, things do change sometimes.  Hopefully this is just a drill, and our Lady Dahlea returns to us soon.  But lets do her proud by not getting too overly excited about it.  Our officer base is very strong and our energies should be focused on our prayers for our friend and leader.</P><P>We all love you Dahlea, please take care =)</P><P><a href="http://loralciriclight.com/" target="_blank"><img src="http://loralciriclight.com/images/loral_sig.gif" border=0></a><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
