        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> Milady Dahlea,<BR>   You have come to my aid on more than one occasion.  You, and folk of your "stripe" are the threads that hold the very fabric of EQ society together.  Thank you for your kindness, and may your future be forever bright.<BR>   Keep in mind, though this is "just a game", the friends you have made will not forget you, and will treasure your acts of kindness, and hold your friendship dear.  If ever you need to talk/vent, I assure you, your friends here will help however they can.  (If ya just wanna beat the snot outta sumthin', I'll even volunteer for that.  *smile* )  <BR>   Sometimes the road we travel has a few potholes....  but that just makes us appreciate the smooth portions that much more.  Remember, keep your eyes on the road ahead, and take each turn as you may.</P><P>/kneel<BR>/bow<BR>/salute </P><P>and of course.....</P><P>/em wraps you up in a big, barbarian Shammy hug!</P><P>Be good, sweetie.</P><P><BR>Wulfgyr Dracokyn<BR>"Hammer of Justice"<BR>Shaman of 39 Winters<BR>Company of Valor<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
