        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> Daklea,</P><P>I wish you well and many happy days. May our paths cross again, if not remember what you learned in EQ.</P><P>Con everything.</P><P>&lt;body&gt;</P><P>&lt;p align="center"&gt;&lt;img border="0" src="http://www.eqportal.com/guild/crimsonsygil/ss_images/kuma_sig.jpg" width="250" height="168"&gt;</P><P>&lt;/body&gt;<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
