        &nbsp;<a href="http://" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Milanaz's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> It's sad to see you go Dahlea.  I really do hope you come back.  You've been a great help to me.  Your always willing to help everyone out when you can.  </P><P>GL to whatever you do next if it's not EQ.</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
