        &nbsp;<a href="http://" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit uwanme22's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> D,<BR>I have known you for almost all of my EQ life.  You are a great person and a wonderful Guild Leader.  You will be missed!  I hope that we can all see you again, but more importantly I hope that RL treats you well.</P><P>Take care and keep in touch!</P><P>-Uwan</P><P> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="FF9933" valign="top">

		<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=18">

		<font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"><b>Wrenne</a>
        </b></font>

        <br><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>Elder</small></font>

        <br><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0><img src=icon_star_red.gif border=0>
        <br>
        <br><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
