        <td bgcolor="FF9933" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;03/02/2002&nbsp;:&nbsp; 00:48:57</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=18"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        

        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> I am so sad to know that RL issues are keeping you from us.  Thankfully, Dahlea, you encouraged us to set guildlines so that the guild could run smoothly even in an event such as this.</P><P>After talking with some of the elders, I have the sense that no major descisions will be made in the short term and any majors ones in the long term will be slowly and carefully made.</P><P>You will be greatly missed.  Hopefully your RL issues will be resolved and the only descisions that have to be made are what kind of sauce to put on the gnome kebabs at the celebration party we can have because you are back with us.</P><P><img src="http://216.118.107.63/SIGS/wrenne3.jpg" border=0><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td bgcolor="white" valign="top">

