        <br><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>1104 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="white" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;03/02/2002&nbsp;:&nbsp; 00:51:21</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=37"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Tierman's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> Wow. I am stunned. <BR>Dahlea, whatever your reasons are we understand that RL comes first. I only hope things aren't too serious and I wish you the best. </P><P>There are few I have come to respect as much. Myself and many others will sorely miss you if this turns out to be a permanent departure :(</P><P>*crosses his fingers and prays for his wonderful leader*</P><P>Tierman Ashkevron<BR>52nd Paladin of Tunare<BR>Healers United</P><P><BR> <a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

