        <br>
        <br><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>6371 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="FF9933" colspan="2" valign="top"><img src="icon_posticon.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;03/02/2002&nbsp;:&nbsp; 01:46:23</font>
        
		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=5"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
        &nbsp;<a href="http://healersunited.com" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Juror's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> I have to admit that I am still sort of in shock.  We have talked about it in the past but possibility of choosing another GL always seemed so remote.</P><P>You helped us so much in the past, I wish we could be there for you now.  </P><P>Take the time you need to decide and if you choose to leave, we will miss you deeply but we will survive.  After all, you did such a good job running the place.  Guild has come a long way since you took over but without sacrificing the doctrine upon which it was founded.</P><P>*hugs Dahlea*</P><P>Be well my friend. A pleasure and honor as always.</P><P><img src="http://216.118.107.63/SIGS/juror.jpg" border=0><BR>Juror Truespirit<BR>Luminary of The Tribunal<BR>Events Coercer... err Coordinator<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
