        &nbsp;<a href="http://" target="_blank"><img src="icon_homepage.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Visit Selinaa's Homepage" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> With great honor and respect , I bid you well Dahlea .  Wherever your paths may lead you , I wish you peace.</P><P>/hugs </P><P>Tanye/Selinaa<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
