        <hr noshade size="1">

        <font color="black" face=" Arial, Helvetica" size="3"> Goodbye Dahlea...you will be dearly missed.  I can only wish you good luck and Pray for your swift return :) </P><P>May Tunare bless you and Guide yo</P><P>Lady Marizeka<BR>52nd Rangerette<BR>Company Of Valor<BR>Ranger O' licks<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
